Package: com.adarsh.wingmanplus
Name: Wingman Plus
Version: 1.0.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Dating companion that works even in apps that block tweaks (Hinge). A floating bubble lives in SpringBoard - never injected into the dating app, so nothing crashes - captures the screen, reads the profile or chat on-device, and writes flirty/romantic/dating replies with Claude or DeepSeek. Tap a reply to copy it, then paste it in.
Maintainer: Adarsh
Author: Adarsh
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
